Material in this repository that the Apache License does NOT cover:

demo/assets/logos/   The Minimal Humans and Story Context Framework logos are
                     trademarks of Minimal Humans. They are included so the
                     demo can recreate the SCF intros; they are not licensed
                     for other use.
demo/assets/audio/   The E1 and D1 soundtracks, generated by the scf-intros
                     project. Minimal Humans, all rights reserved.
demo/assets/fonts/   Fonts from the Fontsource packages, each under the SIL
                     Open Font License 1.1; the licence for each family sits
                     next to it (OFL-<family>.txt).
                     Three tiny subsets stand in for the system fonts the
                     browser fell back to when rendering the originals:
                     dejavu-sans-*-symbols.ttf (one glyph each; Bitstream Vera
                     licence, LICENSE-dejavu.txt) and
                     wqy-zenhei-mono-subset.ttf (six kanji; GPL-2 with the
                     font embedding exception, LICENSE-wqy-zenhei.txt and
                     GPL-2.txt). They are separate works distributed alongside
                     the demo, under their own licences, and are not part of
                     the addon.

No code from Remotion is included. The kit's spring and easing maths are
clean-room implementations of the damped harmonic oscillator and the cubic
Bezier curve. tools/parity uses the remotion npm package at development time
only, to generate reference values for the tests; it is not distributed.
